In /app/frontend/src/pages/Game.jsx around line 463-464, replace the hardcoded 'ak47' with engine.primaryWeaponId (mirror the same fallback used for the shoot payload at line 488). Suggested fix:
    const primaryId = engineRef.current?.primaryWeaponId || 'ak47';
    const curWeapon = engineRef.current?.currentWeapon === 'tertiary' ? 'laser' : primaryId;
This keeps the server-side player.weapon aligned with the lobby loadout and lets the sniper's ADS-only gate + 1-round mag actually take effect in-game.
